# Gate captain of the southern wall. Fighter route into chapter 1:
# intimidate him (Hard) for the mansion's whereabouts, or kill him and loot his gate log.

%rec: OpeningBranch

cond: IsActorInCombatWithPlayer(NPC)
goto: PlayerCombatBranch

cond: HasFlag('Killed(gate_captain)') && !HasFlag('a_toll_paid')
goto: NewCaptain

cond: HasFlag('Killed(gate_captain)')
goto: NewCaptainPaid

cond: HasFlag('LocationKnown(mansion)')
goto: AlreadyTold

cond: true
goto: DefaultIntroduction

%rec: Nodes

name: PlayerCombatBranch
npc: You picked the wrong gate, contractor.
effect: EndConversation

name: AlreadyTold
npc: You know the way. Don't make me regret it.
#
o_text: (Nod at the yard door.) I need five minutes with the dead outside. Two hundred says you never saw me.
o_id: bribe_captain
o_cond: HasFlag('JobAccepted(tags)') && HasItem('gold', 200) && !HasFlag('a_yard_open')
o_goto: Bribed
#
o_text: (Point at the trucks outside. While he looks, lift the yard key off his belt.)
o_id: lift_yard_key
o_cond: HasFlag('JobAccepted(tags)') && !HasFlag('a_yard_open') && !HasFlag('a_lift_failed')
o_test: RollSkill('stealth', 'Medium')
o_succ: KeyLifted
o_fail: LiftFailed
#
o_text: Your airlock log shows a fault. Let me look at the panel before it locks you in.
o_id: spoof_airlock
o_cond: HasFlag('JobAccepted(tags)') && !HasFlag('a_yard_open') && !HasFlag('a_spoof_failed')
o_test: RollSkill('technology', 'Hard')
o_succ: Spoofed
o_fail: SpoofFailed
#
o_text: EBI records office. We're cataloguing the south gate remains. Open the airlock.
o_id: bluff_captain
o_cond: HasFlag('JobAccepted(tags)') && !HasFlag('a_yard_open') && !HasFlag('a_bluff_failed')
o_test: RollSkill('social', 'Hard')
o_succ: Bluffed
o_fail: BluffFailed
#
o_text: I'm going.
o_id: already_bye
o_goto: Bye

name: DefaultIntroduction
npc: Gate's closed to foot traffic. State your business or move along.
#
o_text: Trucks have been going out this gate at night. Where to?
o_id: ask_trucks
o_goto: AskTrucks
#
o_text: (Nod at the yard door.) I need five minutes with the dead outside. Two hundred says you never saw me.
o_id: bribe_captain
o_cond: HasFlag('JobAccepted(tags)') && HasItem('gold', 200) && !HasFlag('a_yard_open')
o_goto: Bribed
#
o_text: (Point at the trucks outside. While he looks, lift the yard key off his belt.)
o_id: lift_yard_key
o_cond: HasFlag('JobAccepted(tags)') && !HasFlag('a_yard_open') && !HasFlag('a_lift_failed')
o_test: RollSkill('stealth', 'Medium')
o_succ: KeyLifted
o_fail: LiftFailed
#
o_text: Your airlock log shows a fault. Let me look at the panel before it locks you in.
o_id: spoof_airlock
o_cond: HasFlag('JobAccepted(tags)') && !HasFlag('a_yard_open') && !HasFlag('a_spoof_failed')
o_test: RollSkill('technology', 'Hard')
o_succ: Spoofed
o_fail: SpoofFailed
#
o_text: EBI records office. We're cataloguing the south gate remains. Open the airlock.
o_id: bluff_captain
o_cond: HasFlag('JobAccepted(tags)') && !HasFlag('a_yard_open') && !HasFlag('a_bluff_failed')
o_test: RollSkill('social', 'Hard')
o_succ: Bluffed
o_fail: BluffFailed
#
o_text: Nothing. Just looking.
o_id: leave
o_goto: Bye

name: AskTrucks
npc: (He doesn't blink.) Outbound traffic is logged, not discussed.
#
o_text: Then I'll take it off your corpse. Your call.
o_id: intimidate
o_test: RollSkill('intimidate', 'Hard')
o_succ: IntimidateSuccess
o_fail: IntimidateFail
#
o_text: Fair enough.
o_goto: Bye

name: IntimidateSuccess
npc: (He glances at the empty yard, then lowers his voice.)
+ Private residence. Old highway, half an hour south. Caterers, security, the lot.
+ You got that from nobody. Now get off my gate.
effect: SetFlag('LocationKnown(mansion)')
effect: EndConversation

name: IntimidateFail
npc: (He rests a hand on his holster.) Try me. Go on.
#
o_text: <Fight>
o_id: fight
o_goto: Fight
#
o_text: Another time.
o_goto: Bye

name: Fight
npc: Thought so.
effect: StartCombat

name: Bye
npc: Move along.
effect: EndConversation

name: Bribed
npc: (The money is gone before you see his hand move.) Airlock's on a timer. Don't touch anything that's still breathing.
effect: StackTransferTo(NPC, 'gold', 200)
effect: SetFlag('a_yard_open')
effect: ClearFlag('south_gate_locked')
effect: ClearFlag('interior_airlock_closed')
effect: ClearFlag('exterior_airlock_closed')
effect: EndConversation

name: Bluffed
npc: (He reads your face for a long second, then shrugs.) Nobody told me. Nobody ever tells me. Go on, records.
effect: SetFlag('a_yard_open')
effect: ClearFlag('south_gate_locked')
effect: ClearFlag('interior_airlock_closed')
effect: ClearFlag('exterior_airlock_closed')
effect: EndConversation

name: KeyLifted
npc: Trucks? Those are EBI. (He turns back. The yard key is already in your pocket.) Move along.
effect: SetFlag('a_yard_open')
effect: ClearFlag('south_gate_locked')
effect: ClearFlag('interior_airlock_closed')
effect: ClearFlag('exterior_airlock_closed')
effect: EndConversation

name: LiftFailed
npc: (He slaps your hand off his belt.) Next time I break it. Move along.
effect: SetFlag('a_lift_failed')
effect: EndConversation

name: Spoofed
npc: (You open the panel, cycle the airlock, and leave it in maintenance mode.) Fault cleared? (He shrugs.) Good. Don't touch it again.
effect: SetFlag('a_yard_open')
effect: ClearFlag('south_gate_locked')
effect: ClearFlag('interior_airlock_closed')
effect: ClearFlag('exterior_airlock_closed')
effect: EndConversation

name: SpoofFailed
npc: (The panel beeps three times and locks.) What did you do? Get away from my gate.
effect: SetFlag('a_spoof_failed')
effect: EndConversation

name: BluffFailed
npc: EBI records. (He laughs.) EBI doesn't send anyone to look at that. That's the point of it. Move along before I log you.
effect: SetFlag('a_bluff_failed')
effect: EndConversation

name: NewCaptain
npc: (Younger, harder, a fresh EBI patch on his sleeve.) The last captain got sloppy. I don't. The yard costs fifty a visit now. Toll.
#
o_text: (Pay the toll.) Fifty.
o_id: pay_toll
o_cond: HasItem('gold', 50)
o_goto: TollPaid
#
o_text: I know what happened to the last one.
o_id: threaten_new
o_test: RollSkill('intimidate', 'Hard')
o_succ: TollWaived
o_fail: Bye
#
o_text: Not today.
o_id: toll_bye
o_goto: Bye

name: TollPaid
npc: (He pockets it and opens the yard.) Don't make me count you twice.
effect: StackTransferTo(NPC, 'gold', 50)
effect: SetFlag('a_toll_paid')
effect: ClearFlag('south_gate_locked')
effect: EndConversation

name: TollWaived
npc: (His jaw works.) ... Go through. Once.
effect: SetFlag('a_toll_paid')
effect: ClearFlag('south_gate_locked')
effect: EndConversation

name: NewCaptainPaid
npc: Paid up. Keep moving.
effect: EndConversation
